        <mxCell id="net_router" value="&lt;b&gt;🔀 Edge Traffic Dispatcher&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px; color: #cbd5e1;&quot;&gt;• `/*` ──▶ Next.js 16 Frontend App&lt;br/&gt;• `/api/*` ──▶ kv-worker API Gateway&lt;br/&gt;• `/upload/*` ──▶ R2 Presigner Service&lt;br/&gt;• `/media/*` ──▶ R2 Object Storage Bucket&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0f172a;strokeColor=#fbbf24;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#ffffff;align=left;spacingLeft=15;" vertex="1" parent="group_edge">
