        <mxCell id="st_kv" value="&lt;b&gt;⚡ Cloudflare KV Edge Cache&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px; color: #cbd5e1;&quot;&gt;• `COMIC_METADATA`: Story catalog &amp; manifests&lt;br/&gt;• `APP_KV`: Route rate limits &amp; temp tokens&lt;br/&gt;• Sub-50ms Global Edge Read Performance&lt;br/&gt;• TTL Cache Eviction (300s TTL)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0f172a;strokeColor=#38bdf8;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#38bdf8;align=left;spacingLeft=15;" vertex="1" parent="group_storage">
