        <mxCell id="db_hyperdrive" value="&lt;b&gt;⚡ Hyperdrive Connection Pool&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px; color: #cbd5e1;&quot;&gt;• Pool ID: `5a02e4b848144795...`&lt;br/&gt;• Low-Latency Edge Connection Pooling&lt;br/&gt;• Prevents Postgres Connection Exhaustion&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0f172a;strokeColor=#38bdf8;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#ffffff;align=left;spacingLeft=15;" vertex="1" parent="group_database">
          <mxGeometry x="25" y="190" width="380" height="100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="db_schema" value="&lt;b&gt;🗄️ PostgreSQL 15+ Schema (`rwnzsmm...`)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px; color: #cbd5e1;&quot;&gt;• `stories`: id, title, slug (unique), tags, cover, views&lt;br/&gt;• `chapters`: id, story_id, content (JSONB R2 URLs)&lt;br/&gt;• `genres` &amp; `tags`: Taxonomy classification tables&lt;br/&gt;• `authors`: id, name, bio, avatar_url&lt;br/&gt;• `bookmarks` &amp; `profiles`: Scoped user library&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0f172a;strokeColor=#10b981;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#ffffff;align=left;spacingLeft=15;" vertex="1" parent="group_database">
          <mxGeometry x="25" y="310" width="380" height="140" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="db_rls" value="&lt;b&gt;🔒 Row-Level Security (RLS) Engine&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px; color: #cbd5e1;&quot;&gt;• Public SELECT on published stories &amp; taxonomy&lt;br/&gt;• Staff mutations: `has_role([&#39;superadmin&#39;,&#39;admin&#39;,&#39;employee&#39;])`&lt;br/&gt;• User bookmark/profile isolation: `user_id = auth.uid()`&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0f172a;strokeColor=#f43f5e;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#4ade80;align=left;spacingLeft=15;" vertex="1" parent="group_database">
          <mxGeometry x="25" y="470" width="380" height="110" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="db_rpc" value="&lt;b&gt;🔍 RPC Stored Procs &amp; Vector Search&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px; color: #cbd5e1;&quot;&gt;• `get_user_engagement_summary(p_time_range)` RPC&lt;br/&gt;• `stories_with_counts`, `popular_comics_view` Views&lt;br/&gt;• `pgvector` Cosine Similarity Embeddings Search&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0f172a;strokeColor=#64748b;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#ffffff;align=left;spacingLeft=15;" vertex="1" parent="group_database">
          <mxGeometry x="25" y="600" width="380" height="110" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="db_migrations" value="&lt;b&gt;MIGRATION PIPELINE&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px; color: #94a3b8;&quot;&gt;• Idempotent DDL Migrations via `apply_migrations.sh` / `.ps1`&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0f172a;strokeColor=#64748b;fontColor=#cbd5e1;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="group_database">
          <mxGeometry x="25" y="730" width="380" height="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <!-- ================= BOTTOM PANELS: BLUEPRINT WORKFLOWS ================= -->
        <mxCell id="panel_wf_read" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px; color: #38bdf8;&quot;&gt;WORKFLOW A: HIGH-SPEED READ &amp; STREAMING PATH&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px; color: #cbd5e1;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt; User requests `/comics/[slug]/[chapter]` ──▶ &lt;b&gt;[2]&lt;/b&gt; Next.js Presenter queries `kv-worker` Gateway ──▶ &lt;b&gt;[3]&lt;/b&gt; Worker checks KV Cache (`COMIC_METADATA`) for chapter manifest (Sub-50ms) ──▶ &lt;b&gt;[4]&lt;/b&gt; On Cache Miss, Worker queries Supabase Postgres via Hyperdrive pool and warms KV ──▶ &lt;b&gt;[5]&lt;/b&gt; Reader Canvas fetches WebP pages directly from Cloudflare R2 CDN (`pub-...r2.dev`) ──▶ &lt;b&gt;[6]&lt;/b&gt; Pages pre-cached in browser `CacheStorage`.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1e293b;strokeColor=#38bdf8;strokeWidth=2;align=left;spacingLeft=20;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="1130" width="1310" height="120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="panel_wf_write" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px; color: #4ade80;&quot;&gt;WORKFLOW B: DIRECT S3 MEDIA UPLOAD &amp; SERVER ACTION MUTATIONS&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px; color: #cbd5e1;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt; Staff requests presigned URL from `POST /api/upload/presigned` ──▶ &lt;b&gt;[2]&lt;/b&gt; Worker validates JWT role claim &amp; generates AWS S3 SigV4 PUT token for `covers/...` or `chapters/...` ──▶ &lt;b&gt;[3]&lt;/b&gt; Browser performs Direct Multipart PUT of WebP image directly to Cloudflare R2 Bucket (Zero server load) ──▶ &lt;b&gt;[4]&lt;/b&gt; Form calls Next.js Server Action (`createComic` / `createChapter`) ──▶ &lt;b&gt;[5]&lt;/b&gt; `act()` executes Zod validation &amp; inserts record into Supabase Postgres.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1e293b;strokeColor=#4ade80;strokeWidth=2;align=left;spacingLeft=20;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1430" y="1130" width="1310" height="120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="panel_wf_security" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px; color: #f43f5e;&quot;&gt;WORKFLOW C: 4-LAYER DEFENSE-IN-DEPTH SECURITY &amp; RBAC&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px; color: #cbd5e1;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Layer 1 (Edge Gate):&lt;/b&gt; `kv-worker` Web Crypto JWT check (`requireRouteAuthorization`) provides fast 401/403 drops at edge ──▶ &lt;b&gt;Layer 2 (Middleware):&lt;/b&gt; Next.js root `middleware.ts` guards `/admin/*` via `@supabase/ssr` cookies ──▶ &lt;b&gt;Layer 3 (UI Guard):&lt;/b&gt; `DEFAULT_ADMIN_MENU_VISIBILITY` filters navigation tabs + `useRoleGuard([&#39;superadmin&#39;])` on dashboard ──▶ &lt;b&gt;Layer 4 (Database RLS):&lt;/b&gt; Postgres Row Level Security verifies `auth.jwt()` role claims on every SQL statement.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1e293b;strokeColor=#f43f5e;strokeWidth=2;align=left;spacingLeft=20;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="1270" width="1310" height="120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="panel_wf_telemetry" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px; color: #fb7185;&quot;&gt;WORKFLOW D: SUPERADMIN TELEMETRY &amp; INFRASTRUCTURE OBSERVABILITY&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px; color: #cbd5e1;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt; Superadmin loads `/admin/dashboard` ──▶ &lt;b&gt;[2]&lt;/b&gt; `useAdminDashboardPresenter` triggers single consolidated fetch to `/api/admin/analytics/dashboard` with 20s timeout ──▶ &lt;b&gt;[3]&lt;/b&gt; Worker `utils/infra.ts` aggregates Cloudflare R2 bucket count (13k objects) + Analytics Engine SQL ──▶ &lt;b&gt;[4]&lt;/b&gt; Calls Supabase RPC `get_user_engagement_summary()` for story totals &amp; bookmarks ──▶ &lt;b&gt;[5]&lt;/b&gt; Returns single unified telemetry payload to render dark-theme gauge cards.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1e293b;strokeColor=#e11d48;strokeWidth=2;align=left;spacingLeft=20;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1430" y="1270" width="1310" height="120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

